The explorer's own change to the query core, not yet a commit of the inventory's core (PakAirQuality/pakistan-emissions-sectors):
query_activity: categories filter any class column; periods ["all"], and a fiscal year (FY 2023-24 or FY2023-24) matches its row and its months July-June; the newest period of a place not named is its province's or level's (older_only names the rest); the row cap is 20,000; a row carries its reporting interval.
Applied on top of the pinned core 3dccf78 and 0001 because the site serves rc59 (scripts/vendor_query_core.py).

